    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713690/extras/5e32f82da7c919564feb1162bc504259.avif?t=1752821650\" width=616 height=178 /></span><strong>Shattered Minds</strong> is an open-world visual novel where you step into the life of a young man gifted with an extraordinary superpower: the ability to subtly influence the thoughts of others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With this newfound power, your world is turned upside down \u2014 offering you the chance to fulfill your desires, shape your destiny, and leave your mark on an entire town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there's a catch. A mighty power like yours never comes without a downside... </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713690/extras/7ecdc663846c97e8b43252a6da34820b.avif?t=1752821650\" width=616 height=346 /></span>Explore an open world where each character goes about their daily routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you which quests to pursue and whose path you want to influence first. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your harem</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713690/extras/569448f6388a62591653296ab86c8626.avif?t=1752821650\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Build the harem of your dreams! Let your girls assist you\u2014have them generate resources, choose their outfits, enjoy intimate moments with them, live together, or even impregnate them if you wish. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every girl is unique</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713690/extras/aebdb3624b101ba9a39b1ebfb72b9ec7.avif?t=1752821650\" width=616 height=346 /></span>Each character in the game has a unique personality, their own story to uncover, and an individual quest line to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every girl, every mind is a challenge of its own. But your power always opens the right doors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Build your empire<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713690/extras/02837f95828ce8cc2bf9cd55953b1c58.avif?t=1752821650\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of buildings and let them generate resources for you. Some building even unlock new girls for you to interact with, expanding your opportunities and influence. Upgrade your buildings to boost their output and unlock even greater potential.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sexy animations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713690/extras/6c94a6a2dbb1ac69cfdeca9da645c9ee.poster.avif?t=1752821650\" width=618 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713690/extras/6c94a6a2dbb1ac69cfdeca9da645c9ee.webm?t=1752821650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713690/extras/6c94a6a2dbb1ac69cfdeca9da645c9ee.mp4?t=1752821650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Animated sex scenes in Shattered Minds run at 30 frames per second and in FullHD. Each animation has at least two camera angles. You can switch between them as often as you like! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Included features at the start of Early Access:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > open world sandbox gameplay mixed with VN elements </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > quest log and inventory system </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >real estate mechanic: take over the town</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 16 main girls to corrupt (and more to come) + side characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 8 unique locations to discover (and more to come) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > level up your character </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > minigames to earn money and XP </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > management part: manage your harem as well as you buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > pregnancy system: impregnate your harem members! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713690/extras/602e6a2f6a22aa54cbaabd9cb029461a.poster.avif?t=1752821650\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713690/extras/602e6a2f6a22aa54cbaabd9cb029461a.webm?t=1752821650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713690/extras/602e6a2f6a22aa54cbaabd9cb029461a.mp4?t=1752821650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Shattered Minds</strong> also includes plenty of animations, a licensed soundtrack, and atmospheric sound effects! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a sexy adventure you won't soon forget!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713690/extras/5e32f82da7c919564feb1162bc504259.avif?t=1752821650\" width=616 height=178 /></span><strong>Shattered Minds</strong> is an open-world visual novel where you step into the life of a young man gifted with an extraordinary superpower: the ability to subtly influence the thoughts of others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With this newfound power, your world is turned upside down \u2014 offering you the chance to fulfill your desires, shape your destiny, and leave your mark on an entire town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there's a catch. A mighty power like yours never comes without a downside... </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713690/extras/7ecdc663846c97e8b43252a6da34820b.avif?t=1752821650\" width=616 height=346 /></span>Explore an open world where each character goes about their daily routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you which quests to pursue and whose path you want to influence first. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your harem</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713690/extras/569448f6388a62591653296ab86c8626.avif?t=1752821650\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Build the harem of your dreams! Let your girls assist you\u2014have them generate resources, choose their outfits, enjoy intimate moments with them, live together, or even impregnate them if you wish. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every girl is unique</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713690/extras/aebdb3624b101