stem </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >real estate mechanic: take over the town</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 16 main girls to corrupt (and more to come) + side characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 8 unique locations to discover (and more to come) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > level up your character </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > minigames to earn money and XP </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > management part: manage your harem as well as you buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > pregnancy system: impregnate your harem members! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713690/extras/602e6a2f6a22aa54cbaabd9cb029461a.poster.avif?t=1752821650\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713690/extras/602e6a2f6a22aa54cbaabd9cb029461a.webm?t=1752821650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713690/extras/602e6a2f6a22aa54cbaabd9cb029461a.mp4?t=1752821650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Shattered Minds</strong> also includes plenty of animations, a licensed soundtrack, and atmospheric sound effects! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a sexy adventure you won't soon forget!</p>",
